an write properly as with this I can't see what I have typed until I get to the next line so its full of mistakes !!Take caareLove Diane**trillien**To: buggerlugsSubj: From the fat one !Date: Jun  7Hi SharonWell another Saturday night and I'm in on my own again...don't I#lead an exciting life ! Davids just gone to work and I've got a night in front of the television to look forward to .I went and bought a new swimming cossie (maternity style !)yesterday as I am going to take up swimming...and yes before youask I am running a temperature !!  All the nurses and doctors havebeen telling us all that we should be swimming so I'm going to take the plunge !!I ordered my cot and pram as well this week..I can't wait to walkdown the street with my pram ...its so swanky  :)I've gutted the spare bedroom as well..its got nothing in it now. Davids dad wants to decorate it so we just have to pick the paper now.Work is getting so busy these days..all these pain in the ****americans are driving us nuts !!!  *GRIN*Never mind only 3 more months then I give up. Don't think I am going to work for the first couple of years then maybe just parttime. David quite likes the idea of me being a housewife !!We'll need to exchange some photos and see now much we've allchanged...I'll be getting the wedding ones developed soI'll send some of them.good news about you and Bill going to be getting some space...I couldn't share now....you two need it now your an old marriedcouple  :)Anyway I'm going to see what exciting things are on tonight...theeshould be a film on the movie channel at least !Take careLove Di**trillien**To: buggerlugsSubj: back at last !Date: Jun 22Hiya !Well Dave really screwed the computer up after the last time I wroteWe couldn't use it at all and he had to reinstall everything !!I'm just about to have a shower then we are heading off on our hols.Hopefully it should be ok..... I'm still abit dubious about being awaywith my parents. Well thats 5 months up now and junior is moving around quite abuit now. You can really tell now by looking at me...its so weird !! I'mpossessed !!Only another 2-3 months left at work then I'm becing a proper housewife :)Not much been happening here lately...weather is really crap...won't stopraining. We've got the spare room stripped as Davids Dad wants to get stuck in straight after his holidays....there away in majorca just now and get back acouple of days after us.Well I better go and get my shower and get ready to go....I'll probably havelots of horror stories to tell you when I get back...Take care...Love Diane**barefoot**To: buggerlugsSubj: remember you!!Date: Jul  5Hi Sharon,of course I do remember you.  Although its a long time ago I last saw youon here.  But I disappeared for a while as well, and Im not reallymudding anymore.  Since Im not at the university, being on here got quiteexpensive.  Usually I just come here to see who is on, and I hardly evermeet anyone I know, so its great to see you are back.I can imagine that it wasnt easy to leave home.    Some time ago I almost did the same.But now I guess Im glad I didnt.  Oh well, maybe if I find the properwoman... :)Ill write again.  Or talk to you on here.  Take care.*HUGS*Ralf**trillien**To: buggerlugsSubj: .Date: Jul  7Hi Sharon !Guess why I've not been on for a few days ????  Yep Daves been playing aroundagain and lost telnet for a few days.....what a surprise !!Hopefully he has learnt his lesson by now !We went through to Glasgow yesterday with Dave and Shelia and got the wallpaperfor the nursery. We went to see Davids dad tonight and hes coming at theweekend to put it up for us ... I can't wait to see it done !We were away buying more things for junior during the week ....more clothes,nappy bin and other bits and pieces so the house is getting cluttered..wecan hardly move in our bedroom at the mo so thats another reason why I can'wait til the nursery is finished so I can move in here again !!I'm having a dilema at work at the mo...the doctor has offered to sign me off work as she says that the shift work is no good for me and I shouldn't be doing it so my boss said she would try to change my shifts for me....but then I get a phone call today to say shes put me back to the way it was before....I knewit was too good to  be true...I'm going to give her til next week and if shedoes the same again I#m just going to get signed off....some things are moreimportant. I can leave on the 29th August and stil get my full maternity payso it looks like thats the latest I'll be there....I'd originally plannedstayong on til september but bugger that !!We got the mail from Rufus...what a guy asking if we can make it on that date !Who knows what we will all be doing that time next year !!!Do you think you will be able to make it over for the wedding ?Dave and I will be going no matter what date it is as I'll not be working and Dave can suit himself what holidays he takes.I've got a pile of ironing that can reach the ceiling so thats going to bemy night !!  What an exciting life I lead !!Daves probably going to playing his new games...one of them is called RedneckRampage and he thinks it excellent !Talk to you soon,Take careLove Diane**trillien**To: buggerlugsSubj: EmailDate: Jul 16Hiya honCan you send me an email so I can get your address...Dave has finallyfinished mucking about and we now have Pegasus mail but I haven'tgot your email anymore...one of the many things that got wiped  :)So how you keeping ??  Why you looking for a new job ?? I thought youwere happy in the job you have at the mo...We were told today that it looks seriously like the hotel going to get soldnow so we all just have to wait and see if we get to keep our jobs....it could screw it up for me with my maternity leave....How did Seans party go ??  Did you phone ??? I bet it was abit tearfulspeaking to all your family...not to mention expensive !Do you see much of Bills family these days ?? Or are you two enjoying your own space too much at the mo !!Not much been happening here lately...Davids just getting fatter by the day !Trying too hard to keep up with me....I'm seriously getting left behind !Hes in the middle of decorating the spare room this week...its startingto look good ..I can't wait til its finished and I can get the placecleaned up abit...typical guy gets everywhere messy !!I've finally discovered a shop where I can get clothes to fit !! I neverthought of it before..Evans...I have been hunting everywhere to try toget underwear to fit me these days...its scarey how big certain parts ofyour anatomy get when your pregnant....*GRIN*...no wonder you get back ache !!I didn't have time to buy anything today which pleased David but...... Imight have to have a look tomorrow before I start work as I'm on a later shiftDavid panics every time I get near shops......especially if it has anythingto do with babies  :)Davids been slagging me off for buying baby magazines lately.....but I caughthim out the other day...hes a closet baby magazine reader...I thought theyhad been mysteriousy moving from room to room and that he was becoming veryknowledgeable on all the facts....then I caught him red handed and he hadto own up !!  Although he was abit shocked at how graphic some of the picswere and some articles were abit too detailed especially when it came tothe birth part !  Its true though...when you see that girlie mags are on the top shelfand then these baby mags are available to anyone and are far more graphic...even I find it difficult looking at then without crossing my legs !!I just don't want to think about that part at the mo...I'll wait til it happens.Well its 12.30 and time for me to hit the hay...Davids waiting not so patiently to get onto play redneck rampage...he loves the game....I'm not so sure....its Quake/Doom in hicky land..the sound efects get abit annoying after bit.Take careLove Diane& Dave**trillien**To: buggerlugsSubj: its me again !Date: Jul 16ps can you send me Rufus's email address too...Thanks !!Diane**hakan**To: buggerlugsSubj: hello!Date: Sep  3Hiya and how's everything...Just passing through here and thought I'd drop you a line.Take care...ue/hakan**hakan**To: buggerlugsSubj: autumnDate: Sep  5hello Sharon,Yes autumn is my favorite time of year too, and for it to arrive so suddenly was terrific!!!  Although of course, now I have to listen to people at work who actually think it's COLD!!!!  *grins*Yes, the Princess' death was a real shocker....I'm amazed at the public show of grief not only in England but all across the country here as well.  I think that what a lot of people here are especially interested in, is watching the House of Windsor cope (or attempt to) changine expectations of them by the public!!For sure, I'll be amongst those people who get up at the crack of dawn on Saturdy to watch the funeral....I do have to admit that European royalty DO know how to present the pomp and ritual of such occasions.Tell Bill hi, and hope that all is well with the two of you!Hugs from Sue**"
